    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"mistake\" though. it feels more like i'm just poison. i see the damage i caused and it feels like i'm a permanent stain on everything i touch. how am i supposed to just \"make things right\" when the person who did it is the problem? it feels like the only thing i've ever truly contributed to the world is this wreckage.",
