      "content": "but what if some things just can't be repaired? what if the \"damage\" is just part of who i am now? i look in the mirror and i don't see someone who can \"do better,\" i just see a person who shouldn't have been here in the first place. it feels like the world would just be cleaner, or at least less burdened, if i wasn't in it.",
